[1.36,"o","How should unstale read new release notes?\r\n"]
[1.42,"o","\r\n"]
[1.48,"o","     Read with                 Cost a year, this repo   Compared with the best option\r\n"]
[1.54,"o","  1  Jev + Vercel AI Gateway   ≈ $0.099                 the best option\r\n"]
[1.6,"o","  2  Vercel AI Gateway         ≈ $0.13                  ≈ 3% less precise labels\r\n"]
[1.66,"o","  3  Anthropic                 ≈ $0.23                  ≈ 90% of its changes\r\n"]
[1.72,"o","  4  Not now                   free                     ≈ 27% of its changes in new releases\r\n"]
[1.78,"o","     Jev: a labelling service, used beside the provider that reads the notes.\r\n"]
[1.84,"o","     Keys: JEV_API_KEY, AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\r\n"]
[1.9,"o","\r\n"]
[1.96,"o","Enter for 1, a number to choose, or d for details:\r\n"]
[2.02,"o","Nothing chosen: new releases get advisories and deprecations only. `unstale setup` asks again.\r\n"]
